### soft delete a projects

DELETE http://127.0.0.1:8000/projects/d9d1e180-9125-420c-abd6-a841e0e44978/

###list all assigned projects:
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/assigned-projects

### Create an assigned project
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/assigned-projects/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "project": 2,
  "coordinator": 2,
  "developers": [7, 4],
  "project_duration": 6,
  "project_start_date": "2026-11-02",
  "project_tentative_end_date": "2026-12-02"
}

### update an assigned project
PATCH http://127.0.0.1:8000/assigned-projects/75f4fae1-fd71-41b4-88a0-d4e417477703/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "developers" : [6,4,5,9]
}

###list all assigned tasks
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/tasks/75f4fae1-fd71-41b4-88a0-d4e417477703/


### create a task
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/tasks/75f4fae1-fd71-41b4-88a0-d4e417477703/
Content-Type: application/json

{

  "assigned_to": 6,
  "title": "Design the project dashboard",
  "description": "Create the initial dashboard layout.",
  "priority": "Medium"
}

